<tr><td colspan=2>For all of you gaming geeks out there in Bloodhorde land that are going to the Origins Game Convention in Columbus, Ohio this weeked... I will be there!  Look for the Living Imagination, Inc. booth in the dealer room.. that's my company.  We just produced a campaign setting for Dungeons and Dragons called "Twin Crowns".  Come on by and support your local gnome!<br>
<br>
If you're interested in meeting other Bloodhorde'rs there, ask for John (that's me), Dana (that's Kartane) or Larry (that's Gnadira).  Hope to see at least one of you there!<br>
<br>
- J, aka Gnormagn Fudder, Retired Cleric</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

